{"id": "sc-01", "question": "按二次探测依次把 89、18、49、58、79 插入大小为 10 的空哈希表，哪些槽位有值？", "question_type": "answerable", "reference_answer": "第 25 页。0→49、2→58、3→79、8→18、9→89，其余为空。", "expected_files": ["11-hash2.pdf"], "gold_evidence": [{"file": "11-hash2.pdf", "locator": {"kind": "page", "value": 25}, "quote": null, "quote_status": "pending", "group": "slots"}], "evidence_status": "locator_only", "notes": "原文片段（第 25 页表格）待抽取后补录；不要手工编造。", "source": "test-materials/search-cases.md#1"}
{"id": "sc-02", "question": "原槽位被占后，二次探测的前四个偏移是多少？当表大小为素数且负载因子小于一半时，能保证什么？", "question_type": "answerable", "reference_answer": "第 24 张给出 1、4、9、16。第 26 或 27 张说明一定能找到空槽。", "expected_files": ["11-hash2.pptx"], "gold_evidence": [{"file": "11-hash2.pptx", "locator": {"kind": "slide", "value": 24}, "quote": null, "quote_status": "pending", "group": "offsets"}, {"file": "11-hash2.pptx", "locator": {"kind": "slide", "value": 26}, "quote": null, "quote_status": "pending", "group": "guarantee"}, {"file": "11-hash2.pptx", "locator": {"kind": "slide", "value": 27}, "quote": null, "quote_status": "pending", "group": "guarantee"}], "evidence_status": "locator_only", "notes": "两组证据；`guarantee` 组内第 26 或 27 张任一命中即可（原文写作「第 26 或 27 张」）。", "source": "test-materials/search-cases.md#2"}
{"id": "sc-03", "question": "Mac 版 Word 的样式窗格中，Normal 和 Heading 1 之间是什么？截图列出了哪些标题级别？", "question_type": "answerable", "reference_answer": "Headings 章节。中间是 No Spacing，标题级别为 Heading 1、Heading 2、Heading 3。", "expected_files": ["UTS-accessible-word.docx"], "gold_evidence": [{"file": "UTS-accessible-word.docx", "locator": {"kind": "section", "value": "Headings"}, "quote": null, "quote_status": "pending", "group": "headings"}], "evidence_status": "locator_only", "notes": "locator 用原文出现的章节标题 Headings（与 ingestion 的 section 元数据一致）。", "source": "test-materials/search-cases.md#3"}
{"id": "sc-04", "question": "「桥梁工程的基本知识」模块支持哪些课程目标？学生有哪两项学习任务？", "question_type": "answerable", "reference_answer": "「教学模块」表的桥梁示例行。支持目标 1、4、5。学生在蓝墨云班课平台观看桥梁视频，并撰写桥梁发展与创新报告。", "expected_files": ["USST-syllabus.docx"], "gold_evidence": [{"file": "USST-syllabus.docx", "locator": {"kind": "table_row", "value": "教学模块"}, "quote": null, "quote_status": "pending", "group": "module_table"}], "evidence_status": "locator_only", "notes": "表格题：Word 原生表格单独成块，locator 记表所在章节「教学模块」。", "source": "test-materials/search-cases.md#4"}
{"id": "sc-05", "question": "打开 Check Accessibility 用哪个选项卡？表格列用交替底色的选项叫什么？", "question_type": "answerable", "reference_answer": "第 4 张的 Review 选项卡和第 17 张的 Banded Columns。", "expected_files": ["UTS-accessible-powerpoint.pptx"], "gold_evidence": [{"file": "UTS-accessible-powerpoint.pptx", "locator": {"kind": "slide", "value": 4}, "quote": null, "quote_status": "pending", "group": "tab"}, {"file": "UTS-accessible-powerpoint.pptx", "locator": {"kind": "slide", "value": 17}, "quote": null, "quote_status": "pending", "group": "banded"}], "evidence_status": "locator_only", "notes": "两个独立证据组，都必须命中（与 sc-02 的备选组不同）。", "source": "test-materials/search-cases.md#5"}
{"id": "sc-06", "question": "云盘支持哪些课件格式？「打开云盘课件内容上课」这页截图中，与试卷和授权有关的列表项叫什么？", "question_type": "answerable", "reference_answer": "第 8 页。格式为 EDB 板书、PPT、PDF、Word、图片、音频、视频和 TXT，截图里有「试卷资源」和「授权资源」。", "expected_files": ["USTC-ClassIn.pdf"], "gold_evidence": [{"file": "USTC-ClassIn.pdf", "locator": {"kind": "page", "value": 8}, "quote": null, "quote_status": "pending", "group": "page8"}], "evidence_status": "locator_only", "notes": "答案同时来自第 8 页正文与截图 OCR 文本，属跨模态证据，原文片段待补。", "source": "test-materials/search-cases.md#6"}
